WEBVTT

01:37.190 --> 01:39.896
[Episode 4]

01:58.500 --> 02:00.871
[Xiqiao Ferry]

02:27.033 --> 02:28.333
Chieftain Zhong,

02:28.333 --> 02:30.100
are you here to watch a show?

02:30.100 --> 02:32.766
Immobilized by Zhan Zhao's
Heavenward Crane Strike,

02:32.766 --> 02:34.233
I can't move a muscle.

02:34.233 --> 02:35.333
What about the Iron Blood Guards?

02:35.333 --> 02:38.166
Iron Blood Guards has a rule.
They never kill the innocent.

02:38.166 --> 02:41.100
We won't break the rule for the Xiuluo Cult.

02:41.100 --> 02:42.466
For Xiuluo Cult?

02:42.466 --> 02:44.299
It's for His Lordship's great cause!

02:44.299 --> 02:47.040
Then show me His Lordship's command token.

02:47.040 --> 02:48.720
What?

02:50.966 --> 02:52.500
Fine.

02:52.500 --> 02:54.766
I see how it is now.

02:54.766 --> 02:56.899
You just want to reap the benefits
without lifting a finger.

02:56.899 --> 02:58.133
I didn't step in,

02:58.133 --> 03:00.299
so you don't have to split your glory.

03:00.299 --> 03:01.566
Now,

03:01.566 --> 03:04.832
all the credit belongs to you.

05:23.920 --> 05:26.099
You don't even spare your partner.

05:26.099 --> 05:29.099
The Yunying Sect people only know
some lightness skills, flashy but useless.

05:29.099 --> 05:30.433
They'll never amount to anything.

05:30.433 --> 05:32.066
He died for me.

05:32.066 --> 05:35.536
That was an honorable end for him.

05:36.580 --> 05:38.220
- Don't move.
- Mom, Dad!

05:38.220 --> 05:41.126
- Please, save my son!
- Save my brother!

05:41.126 --> 05:42.426
One more step,

05:42.426 --> 05:44.976
and I'll snap his neck.

05:50.400 --> 05:54.040
I beg you. Save my son!

05:55.193 --> 05:57.226
Don't worry.

05:57.226 --> 05:59.597
I will definitely save him.

06:12.526 --> 06:13.826
Zhan Zhao,

06:13.826 --> 06:15.793
Heavenward Crane Strike can help you leave.

06:15.793 --> 06:17.693
But if you use it to save that child,

06:17.693 --> 06:20.259
I'm afraid you'll never cross this ferry.

06:20.259 --> 06:21.460
At noon,

06:21.460 --> 06:24.026
the poison in your body will flare up.

06:24.026 --> 06:26.726
Without Heavenward Crane Strike as a protector.

06:26.726 --> 06:27.926
Death

06:27.926 --> 06:30.380
is coming for you.

06:50.093 --> 06:51.426
I knew it.

06:51.426 --> 06:53.793
You wouldn't dare kill me.

06:53.793 --> 06:56.660
The Southern Knight became an official.

06:56.660 --> 06:58.026
You have your titles and your gold,

06:58.026 --> 07:00.793
but put the law's chains on your own neck.

07:00.793 --> 07:03.450
Don't you find it ridiculous?

07:04.226 --> 07:06.860
You pride yourself on being chivalrous,

07:06.860 --> 07:08.993
yet you don't even have the courage

07:08.993 --> 07:12.260
to kill me and uphold justice.

07:14.059 --> 07:17.093
If Liu Hong Yi knew you were like this,

07:17.093 --> 07:20.293
I'm afraid he'd also resent your cowardice.

07:20.293 --> 07:23.526
I've poisoned him
with over ten Xiuluo Cult poisons.

07:23.526 --> 07:26.326
None of them will kill him instantly.

07:26.326 --> 07:29.893
But they will slowly melt his internal organs.

07:29.893 --> 07:31.793
He will rot from the inside out

07:31.793 --> 07:35.159
until he turns into a pool of blood.

08:01.526 --> 08:04.026
The Yunying Sect

08:04.026 --> 08:07.493
has never turned a blind eye to villains.

08:07.493 --> 08:09.926
I killed Mo Dao.

08:09.926 --> 08:11.581
My master's soul

08:11.581 --> 08:17.581
can finally know peace.

09:29.860 --> 09:31.593
Past the farmhouse ahead

09:31.593 --> 09:33.259
is Xiqiao Ferry.

09:33.259 --> 09:34.626
Once across that river,

09:34.626 --> 09:37.126
it is no longer under Xiangzhou's jurisdiction.

09:37.126 --> 09:38.659
Another 20 miles

09:38.659 --> 09:40.193
will lead to Yincheng Town,

09:40.193 --> 09:42.326
where the Guanghua Army is stationed.

09:42.326 --> 09:44.393
Their commander, Meng Kui, is my friend.

09:44.393 --> 09:47.226
He'll send men to escort me all the way north.

09:47.226 --> 09:48.926
With a fast horse,

09:48.926 --> 09:50.460
I can reach the capital

09:50.460 --> 09:52.832
in less than two days.

10:02.493 --> 10:03.517
Got him?

10:03.517 --> 10:05.266
Yes, got him.

10:40.626 --> 10:42.726
Did you search him thoroughly?

10:42.726 --> 10:45.259
Zhan Zhao doesn't have that object.

10:45.259 --> 10:47.793
I've sent men to find his companion.

10:47.793 --> 10:49.126
Wait till he wakes.

10:49.126 --> 10:51.659
Then make him tell us where his companion is.

10:51.659 --> 10:54.026
To make Zhan Zhao tell you?

10:54.026 --> 10:57.126
You must be dreaming.

10:57.126 --> 10:58.393
Chieftain Zhong,

10:58.393 --> 10:59.793
instead of sitting here

10:59.793 --> 11:01.393
waiting for him to wake up,

11:01.393 --> 11:03.093
why don't you use your head

11:03.093 --> 11:05.593
and go find some clues?

11:05.593 --> 11:09.259
Since Zhan Zhao was caught,
every crossing is being watched more closely.

11:09.259 --> 11:11.259
Still no sign of his companion.

11:11.259 --> 11:13.126
Besides waiting for him to talk,

11:13.126 --> 11:14.726
what else can we do?

11:14.726 --> 11:15.993
Commander Shao,

11:15.993 --> 11:18.693
would you show me how?

11:25.126 --> 11:27.626
Where did you find Zhan Zhao?

11:27.626 --> 11:30.126
My men encountered Zhan Zhao and his companion

11:30.126 --> 11:31.786
on the mountain road to Xiqiao Ferry.

11:31.786 --> 11:37.760
Later, I found him hiding in an abandoned barn
near the ferry.

11:37.760 --> 11:39.893
What did Zhan Zhao's companion

11:39.893 --> 11:41.259
look like?

11:41.259 --> 11:43.707
- Wei Feng.
- Yes.

11:47.193 --> 11:48.916
Report to Commander Shao.

11:48.916 --> 11:50.893
What did Zhan Zhao's companion

11:50.893 --> 11:51.893
look like?

11:51.893 --> 11:53.060
Yes.

11:53.060 --> 11:54.326
Commander Shao,

11:54.326 --> 11:56.893
it was a young man around 18 or 19.

11:56.893 --> 11:58.126
Quite handsome,

11:58.126 --> 11:59.526
with impressive martial arts.

11:59.526 --> 12:00.826
He barely made a move.

12:00.826 --> 12:03.193
We were finished before we could fight back.

12:03.193 --> 12:05.193
His weapon was very strange.

12:05.193 --> 12:06.226
It was entirely black,

12:06.226 --> 12:08.276
like a mace.

12:16.259 --> 12:17.826
Commander Shao,

12:17.826 --> 12:20.193
His Lordship ordered us to capture him alive.

12:20.193 --> 12:22.226
If you wish to kill Zhan Zhao,

12:22.226 --> 12:25.285
report to His Lordship yourself.

12:35.659 --> 12:38.226
The ferry capture of Zhan Zhao was hard-won.

12:38.226 --> 12:39.659
As Zhong Xiong stood by and did nothing,

12:39.659 --> 12:41.026
we suffered many casualties.

12:41.026 --> 12:42.526
Even Mo Dao died.

12:42.526 --> 12:43.527
I'm wondering

12:43.527 --> 12:45.526
if Zhong Xiong is dragging his feet on purpose.

12:45.526 --> 12:47.709
He doesn't want to go after that companion.

12:48.659 --> 12:51.126
Zhong Xiong thinks very highly of himself.

12:51.126 --> 12:52.293
Aside from His Lordship,

12:52.293 --> 12:54.526
he rarely respects anyone else.

12:54.526 --> 12:57.726
To be hauled to the ferry like that,

12:57.726 --> 12:59.293
before so many eyes,

12:59.293 --> 13:00.726
unable to move a finger.

13:00.726 --> 13:02.726
He must have been so ashamed.

13:02.726 --> 13:05.226
If he loses Zhan Zhao's companion now,

13:05.226 --> 13:07.193
he won't be able to explain himself.

13:07.193 --> 13:09.686
So, Commander, you mean...

13:14.293 --> 13:16.460
It's not that he won't go looking for them.

13:16.460 --> 13:18.293
He's as thick as you are.

13:18.293 --> 13:20.723
Neither of you knows where to go.

13:31.193 --> 13:34.060
Zhong Xiong is such a fool.

13:34.060 --> 13:36.893
Zhan Zhao's companion was clearly in the barn.

13:36.893 --> 13:40.252
Yet he let them escape right under his nose.

13:41.226 --> 13:43.893
Zhan Zhao's companion
has indeed impressive lightness skills.

13:43.893 --> 13:45.993
Or the footprints wouldn't be so light.

13:45.993 --> 13:47.693
But look at the prints.

13:47.693 --> 13:50.426
One's deep, the other's light.

13:50.426 --> 13:52.759
He may have wounded his leg.

13:59.426 --> 14:02.293
He may have already left Xiangzhou.

14:02.293 --> 14:03.393
That's impossible.

14:03.393 --> 14:05.860
We've locked down all the routes to Xiangzhou.

14:05.860 --> 14:08.593
He won't escape, not even if he had wings.

14:08.593 --> 14:11.826
We did lock down all the routes
before the battle,

14:11.826 --> 14:13.526
but after capturing Zhan Zhao,

14:13.526 --> 14:15.826
we overlooked one place.

14:15.826 --> 14:16.926
Xiqiao Ferry.

14:16.926 --> 14:19.526
Zhan Zhao made a fool of Zhong Xiong.

14:19.526 --> 14:21.293
Zhan Zhao saw all of this coming.

14:21.293 --> 14:24.860
When Zhong Xiong discovered
the letter wasn't on him,

14:24.860 --> 14:26.793
he thought the desperate battle at Xiqiao Ferry

14:26.793 --> 14:29.293
was just to buy time

14:29.293 --> 14:30.726
to allow his companion

14:30.726 --> 14:33.493
to escape with the letter.

14:33.493 --> 14:35.193
Zhan Zhao is clever.

14:35.193 --> 14:38.193
I'll give him that.

14:38.193 --> 14:41.826
Even though he's severely wounded
and all alone,

14:41.826 --> 14:43.526
he's still more than a match

14:43.526 --> 14:45.193
for Zhong Xiong and the others.

14:45.193 --> 14:48.060
No wonder Liu Hong Yi searched for him.

14:48.060 --> 14:49.926
It's just a pity

14:49.926 --> 14:51.826
that I won't have the chance

14:51.826 --> 14:54.959
to cross swords with such a formidable man.

15:00.026 --> 15:02.726
So we know his companion's leg is hurt.

15:02.726 --> 15:04.926
Hunting one young man blind,

15:04.926 --> 15:07.060
it's like searching the woods

15:07.060 --> 15:08.860
for a single leaf.

15:08.860 --> 15:10.726
Not really.

15:10.726 --> 15:12.193
Have you forgotten?

15:12.193 --> 15:15.893
That person carries
a weapon that is rare in this world.

15:15.893 --> 15:18.674
Did you already know who he is?

15:20.193 --> 15:21.926
You think

15:21.926 --> 15:24.259
Zhan Zhao would still be breathing

15:24.259 --> 15:25.326
without Linglong Honey

15:25.326 --> 15:27.120
from Linglong Manor?

15:27.120 --> 15:29.560
So that is...

15:30.293 --> 15:31.693
To Xiqiao Ferry.

15:31.693 --> 15:33.925
Cross the river and keep pursuing.

15:35.626 --> 15:37.060
Let's go.

15:53.426 --> 15:54.659
She's disappeared?

15:54.659 --> 15:56.926
We argued yesterday.

15:56.926 --> 15:58.426
By dusk, no one could find her.

15:58.426 --> 16:00.726
She knew I would come today
to send the betrothal gifts.

16:00.726 --> 16:02.693
Is she fleeing the wedding on purpose?

16:02.693 --> 16:04.759
[Huo Tian Xing, Chief of the Linglong Manor]
Uh...

16:07.805 --> 16:09.423
I thought what we had,

16:09.423 --> 16:12.826
growing up together...
No bond could ever match it.

16:12.826 --> 16:16.093
Does she not feel the same way?

16:16.093 --> 16:17.999
Nephew, don't overthink it.

16:17.999 --> 16:21.040
I scolded Ling Long. Nothing more.

16:21.040 --> 16:23.320
She's likely run off to stay with her kin.

16:23.320 --> 16:25.760
We won't delay the wedding date.

16:48.893 --> 16:50.613
Take care.

16:59.293 --> 17:01.026
Young master, your tea's gotten cold.

17:01.026 --> 17:03.193
- Let me get you a fresh, hot one.
- No need.

17:03.193 --> 17:05.193
How do I get to Yincheng Town?

17:05.193 --> 17:06.693
Yincheng Town?

17:06.693 --> 17:08.326
Go outside and head straight west.

17:08.326 --> 17:09.493
You'll be there in 20 miles.

17:09.493 --> 17:11.493
But look, it's almost dark.

17:11.493 --> 17:12.860
There won't be any lodging left

17:12.860 --> 17:15.592
if you set out this late.

17:16.426 --> 17:17.459
I see.

17:17.459 --> 17:18.475
Thanks.

17:18.475 --> 17:20.543
Thank you.

17:45.693 --> 17:47.630
Everyone, out.

17:53.224 --> 17:54.392
You too.

17:54.392 --> 17:55.946
Yes.

18:04.626 --> 18:06.395
Ling Long.

18:07.393 --> 18:10.026
Even if you quarreled with Uncle-Master Huo,

18:10.026 --> 18:12.659
you shouldn't have run away from home.

18:12.659 --> 18:14.693
Do you know how worried I was?

18:14.693 --> 18:18.226
It seems my father hasn't told you the truth.

18:18.226 --> 18:19.793
I didn't run away from home

18:19.793 --> 18:21.526
because I quarreled with him.

18:21.526 --> 18:24.249
I just don't want to marry you.

18:25.226 --> 18:26.999
Ling Long.

18:58.540 --> 19:01.922
[Huo Ling Long,
Young Lady of the Linglong Manor.]

19:22.209 --> 19:23.964
Let go of me.

19:24.600 --> 19:26.459
You left without a word for so many days.

19:26.459 --> 19:28.126
Uncle-Master Huo is so worried.

19:28.126 --> 19:29.520
I've said it before.

19:29.520 --> 19:30.863
I won't stay if he forces a marriage on me.

19:30.863 --> 19:31.926
He just didn't believe me.

19:31.926 --> 19:33.626
If you don't want to marry me so soon,

19:33.626 --> 19:35.093
you could have told me.

19:35.093 --> 19:37.326
I'll tell Lord of Xiangyang
to postpone it for months.

19:37.326 --> 19:38.793
Why you do this?

19:38.793 --> 19:40.260
I'll say it one last time.

19:40.260 --> 19:42.559
I don't want to marry you.

19:44.693 --> 19:46.993
Whether you want to marry me or not,

19:46.993 --> 19:48.626
you must come back with me.

19:48.626 --> 19:51.226
We can clear things up in front of your dad.

19:51.226 --> 19:53.409
Clear things up?

19:55.226 --> 19:56.659
Are you forcing me back

19:56.659 --> 19:58.459
to clear things up about the marriage,

19:58.459 --> 20:01.070
or for what's in my hands?

20:02.293 --> 20:04.793
I came here because I'm worrying about you.

20:04.793 --> 20:07.443
Why are you hunting Zhan Zhao?

20:10.393 --> 20:12.926
I received orders to capture him.

20:12.926 --> 20:15.426
My duty is to follow orders.

20:15.426 --> 20:18.826
Ling Long, youth makes you blind
to what men truly are.

20:18.826 --> 20:21.459
How can you trust a man
you've only known for days?

20:21.459 --> 20:23.860
Don't you think that's too dangerous?

20:23.860 --> 20:26.893
You must be fooled by his title
as the Southern Knight,

20:26.893 --> 20:29.826
and fell for his hypocritical act.

20:29.826 --> 20:33.126
Besides, how do you know he's really Zhan Zhao?

20:33.126 --> 20:35.226
You know very well

20:35.226 --> 20:37.860
whether he's Zhan Zhao or not.

20:37.860 --> 20:39.593
What I've experienced in these few days

20:39.593 --> 20:42.260
is more than in ten years at the Manor.

20:42.260 --> 20:44.545
I can tell who is a hypocrite.

20:44.545 --> 20:46.440
Ling Long.

20:46.440 --> 20:48.540
Fine.

20:48.540 --> 20:50.393
Arguing was not my strength, Ling Long.

20:50.393 --> 20:53.053
Let's say Zhan Zhao is a good man.

20:53.053 --> 20:54.926
He helps those in need. My apologies.

20:54.926 --> 20:57.740
I shouldn't have followed orders blindly.

20:57.740 --> 20:59.642
I apologize to you.

21:00.606 --> 21:02.539
But have you thought about this?

21:02.539 --> 21:05.000
People like Mo Dao are no good men.

21:05.000 --> 21:07.700
If Zhan Zhao were to die under torture,

21:07.700 --> 21:10.706
no matter how much injustice there is,

21:10.706 --> 21:13.906
he won't be able to see it,
let alone do anything about it.

21:13.906 --> 21:16.073
Perhaps Zhan Zhao is acting on other's orders.

21:16.073 --> 21:18.006
Simply because of a friend's request,

21:18.006 --> 21:19.573
he might die at the hands of

21:19.573 --> 21:20.800
a bunch of nobodies.

21:20.800 --> 21:23.040
Isn't that too high a price?

21:29.140 --> 21:30.640
If it were in the past,

21:30.640 --> 21:33.206
I would have definitely thought you were right.

21:33.206 --> 21:35.140
What exactly is this object about?

21:35.140 --> 21:38.131
Whether you've sided with the wicked
and wronged him.

21:38.993 --> 21:42.340
We'll know when the court sees the evidence.

21:42.340 --> 21:44.106
Why are you so impatient?

21:44.106 --> 21:47.062
Why are you hunting him with such an uproar?

21:48.173 --> 21:51.680
I know you're here for what I have.

21:51.680 --> 21:53.773
Can't the mask come off after all these years?

21:53.773 --> 21:56.206
- How impudent!
- Can't keep up the act any longer?

21:56.206 --> 21:57.906
Then you'd better think carefully.

21:57.906 --> 21:59.173
If you offend me,

21:59.173 --> 22:01.206
will you get Linglong Eye?

22:01.206 --> 22:03.510
What nonsense are you talking?

22:03.510 --> 22:05.410
I want to marry you
because we are meant for each other.

22:05.410 --> 22:06.693
What does it matter with the Linglong Eye?

22:06.693 --> 22:08.693
It's common knowledge that
the Huo family's dowry

22:08.693 --> 22:12.260
features the Linglong Eye,
the priceless family treasure.

22:12.260 --> 22:14.993
Isn't this why you rushed into the betrothal?

22:14.993 --> 22:16.860
Just admit it. It's not shameful.

22:16.860 --> 22:18.793
Huo Ling Long.

22:18.793 --> 22:21.026
I'll give you one last chance.

22:21.026 --> 22:24.180
I've shown more than enough respect
to you and to Linglong Manor.

22:24.180 --> 22:26.180
Now, come back with me,

22:26.180 --> 22:27.659
and I'll pretend nothing happened.

22:27.659 --> 22:28.926
What if I refuse?

22:28.926 --> 22:30.260
You can't escape

22:30.260 --> 22:32.560
from me.

22:52.920 --> 22:55.093
- Hand it over and come back with me.
- Never.

22:55.093 --> 22:57.593
Two days. And now you're ready
to throw your life away for him?

22:57.593 --> 22:59.640
Did you get a crush on him?

22:59.640 --> 23:01.060
Nonsense.

23:01.060 --> 23:02.493
There is nothing between us.

23:02.493 --> 23:04.060
It's better that way.

23:04.060 --> 23:07.526
His Heavenward Crane Strike is
the secret technique of the Ding family.

23:07.526 --> 23:10.260
He's clearly not Ding Zhao.

23:10.260 --> 23:13.060
So he must be the Ding family's
future son-in-law.

23:13.060 --> 23:15.893
Don't make a fool of yourself.

23:15.893 --> 23:18.393
Since you refuse to hand it over,

23:18.393 --> 23:21.213
I'll have to take it by force.

23:33.700 --> 23:35.873
[Bai Yu Tang, Jinmao Rat]

23:35.873 --> 23:37.573
My apologies.

23:37.573 --> 23:39.173
Just slipped.

23:39.173 --> 23:41.373
You continue.

23:41.373 --> 23:42.806
What are you laughing at?

23:42.806 --> 23:43.990
I'm laughing because

23:43.990 --> 23:45.340
a grown man is fighting a lady

23:45.340 --> 23:47.906
whose strength and size are no match for yours,

23:47.906 --> 23:49.173
and you're still struggling.

23:49.173 --> 23:50.773
Isn't that funny?

23:50.773 --> 23:52.140
How long have you been watching?

23:52.140 --> 23:54.073
I've been here eating plums all along.

23:54.073 --> 23:55.539
You're the ones who barged in.

23:55.539 --> 23:57.906
Shouting, cursing, and fighting.

23:57.906 --> 23:59.850
This is my private family matter.

23:59.850 --> 24:01.516
Sorry for disturbing you.

24:01.516 --> 24:02.980
Forgive me.

24:02.980 --> 24:05.423
Stop talking nonsense.

24:06.080 --> 24:07.573
He's just a wretched little man.

24:07.573 --> 24:08.973
I have nothing to do with him.

24:08.973 --> 24:10.973
I know.

24:10.973 --> 24:13.539
I accidentally overheard everything.

24:13.539 --> 24:15.006
His goal this time

24:15.006 --> 24:16.340
isn't to force you into marriage.

24:16.340 --> 24:18.806
It's for an object you're carrying.

24:18.806 --> 24:22.173
You'd better not meddle.

24:22.173 --> 24:25.373
Cross swords with me for a stranger?

24:25.373 --> 24:26.606
That's a fool's bargain.

24:26.606 --> 24:28.106
I think you've misunderstood.

24:28.106 --> 24:29.406
I never said I'd interfere.

24:29.406 --> 24:31.497
You're not going to save her?

24:32.973 --> 24:34.473
Why should I save her?

24:34.473 --> 24:36.273
Her martial arts are far superior to yours.

24:36.273 --> 24:37.820
She can defeat you with ease.

24:37.820 --> 24:39.709
No need for my help.

24:47.206 --> 24:48.306
Lady,

24:48.306 --> 24:49.520
you have such great skills.

24:49.520 --> 24:50.806
How can you not even defeat him?

24:50.806 --> 24:52.463
It makes no sense.

24:52.463 --> 24:54.073
Please don't mock me.

24:54.073 --> 24:55.340
I'm no match for him.

24:55.340 --> 24:56.340
What are you afraid of?

24:56.340 --> 25:00.040
With just a little guidance from me,
you can defeat him.

25:00.040 --> 25:02.310
I wonder if you have the patience,

25:02.310 --> 25:03.640
and the grace to accept defeat.

25:03.640 --> 25:06.273
I know her martial arts well.

25:06.273 --> 25:08.739
If you want to guide her,

25:08.739 --> 25:10.590
do it.

25:13.506 --> 25:14.739
What exactly do you want?

25:14.739 --> 25:15.906
What else can I do?

25:15.906 --> 25:17.306
You don't know the trick of it.

25:17.306 --> 25:19.452
Let me put you on the right path.

25:22.260 --> 25:24.573
But I'm no match for him.

25:24.573 --> 25:27.406
We've matched countless times since childhood,
and I've never won once.

25:27.406 --> 25:28.706
Those were just practice.

25:28.706 --> 25:30.720
Now it's a life-or-death struggle.

25:30.720 --> 25:32.670
Of course you can't win
if you only think about winning.

25:32.670 --> 25:34.160
What you need to think about

25:34.160 --> 25:36.360
is how to kill him.

25:38.573 --> 25:40.958
My leg is injured now.
Even less likely to kill him.

25:40.958 --> 25:42.900
Come on. Forget about your leg injury.

25:42.900 --> 25:44.173
You must use all your strength

25:44.173 --> 25:46.373
to overcome your own cowardice.

25:46.373 --> 25:48.106
Weapons are meant for killing.

25:48.106 --> 25:50.400
Every time you draw your mace, mean to kill.

25:50.400 --> 25:52.410
Never stop until the enemy is dead.

25:52.410 --> 25:53.706
Besides,

25:53.706 --> 25:55.960
you're holding a peerless divine weapon.

25:55.960 --> 25:58.539
What a fine mace.

25:58.539 --> 26:01.320
His sword is no match for yours.

26:01.320 --> 26:03.760
So what is there to be afraid of?

26:18.106 --> 26:19.106
It's been quite a while.

26:19.106 --> 26:20.940
Commander Shao hasn't returned yet.

26:20.940 --> 26:22.563
Is it that hard to catch a young girl?

26:22.563 --> 26:25.173
What a blockhead.

26:25.173 --> 26:28.940
That's Commander Shao's fiancée.

26:28.940 --> 26:30.706
How could he get rough with her?

26:30.706 --> 26:33.539
He has to use sweet words

26:33.539 --> 26:34.706
before she'll come back.

26:34.706 --> 26:37.573
How about... we go back and take a look?

26:37.573 --> 26:39.739
Are you crazy? If you go back now

26:39.739 --> 26:41.539
and walk in on them,

26:41.539 --> 26:43.539
he'll smash your ugly head in.

26:43.539 --> 26:45.473
You'd better think this through.

26:45.473 --> 26:47.680
I won't show any mercy this time.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.906
What a coincidence.

26:48.906 --> 26:51.246
I won't show any mercy either.

27:08.673 --> 27:09.739
Here it is.

27:09.739 --> 27:11.240
That's your real skill.

27:11.240 --> 27:12.859
Ling Long, are you serious?

27:12.859 --> 27:14.940
I just said I wouldn't show any mercy.

27:14.940 --> 27:17.465
It's you who underestimated me.

27:19.836 --> 27:21.135
He's just bluffing.

27:21.135 --> 27:23.098
No need to fear him.

27:56.539 --> 28:00.290
It seems you've backed the wrong side.

28:10.373 --> 28:12.600
Didn't you say you wouldn't intervene?

28:12.600 --> 28:15.073
Are you going back on your word?

28:15.073 --> 28:17.406
Actually, I was entrusted

28:17.406 --> 28:20.236
to escort this lady to the capital.

28:20.236 --> 28:21.443
You mean Zhan Zhao?

28:21.443 --> 28:22.773
Exactly.

28:22.773 --> 28:25.006
After being injured,
he sent me a message via pigeon,

28:25.006 --> 28:26.273
asking me to come.

28:26.273 --> 28:27.700
Then you are...

28:27.700 --> 28:29.140
Didn't you just say it?

28:29.140 --> 28:31.806
Zhan Zhao's Heavenward Crane Strike
is Ding's secret technique.

28:31.806 --> 28:33.573
The Ding Twins?

28:33.573 --> 28:36.273
Correct. I am Ding Zhao Hui.

28:36.273 --> 28:39.539
My brother, Ding Zhao Lan, and the others
are on their way here.

28:39.539 --> 28:41.020
As you said,

28:41.020 --> 28:42.773
Zhan Zhao is the Ding family's son-in-law.

28:42.773 --> 28:44.073
If anything happens to him,

28:44.073 --> 28:46.573
the Ding family won't stand by and do nothing.

28:46.573 --> 28:49.006
I'm sure you've seen
Zhan Zhao's Heavenward Crane Strike.

28:49.006 --> 28:50.073
He's trained well.

28:50.073 --> 28:51.606
He's my brother's equal in that skill.

28:51.606 --> 28:52.906
As for me,

28:52.906 --> 28:54.206
I'm slightly less skilled,

28:54.206 --> 28:55.886
but enough to hold you off for a while.

28:55.886 --> 28:56.973
When my brother arrives,

28:56.973 --> 28:59.156
you can match yourself against him.

29:33.406 --> 29:34.539
How about it?

29:34.539 --> 29:35.906
My Heavenward Crane Strike.

29:35.906 --> 29:37.625
Not bad, right?

29:41.506 --> 29:43.030
Are you really Zhan Zhao's friend?

29:43.030 --> 29:45.000
I know you want to save Zhan Zhao.

29:45.000 --> 29:47.973
But I reckon this man's curs will be here soon.

29:47.973 --> 29:49.473
We need a plan.

29:49.473 --> 29:51.606
Plus, your leg is wounded.

29:51.606 --> 29:53.000
We must not stay here long.

29:53.000 --> 29:55.200
Let's leave first.

29:56.473 --> 29:58.458
Strange.

29:59.206 --> 30:01.604
Where are they?

30:27.073 --> 30:29.180
This was torn from Commander Shao's clothes.

30:29.180 --> 30:31.983
[Tomorrow at dawn. The hostage exchange.
Luosi Cave. Jiangjia Village.]

30:32.773 --> 30:34.840
Damn it. They've taken Commander Shao.

30:34.840 --> 30:37.040
- Let's go.
- Go!

31:05.373 --> 31:07.606
Apply these herbs to your wound.

31:07.606 --> 31:10.612
For the pain. And to speed the healing.

31:11.373 --> 31:13.179
Thank you.

31:13.973 --> 31:15.160
You know medicine?

31:15.160 --> 31:16.539
A man who's always on the road

31:16.539 --> 31:19.539
must know how to tend to simple wounds.

31:19.539 --> 31:22.566
Your leg won't let you fight like that again.

31:22.566 --> 31:25.566
If you want to save him, end this quickly.

31:25.566 --> 31:27.666
Didn't you say your brother was coming?

31:27.666 --> 31:29.300
How many men did he bring with him?

31:29.300 --> 31:30.499
I lied.

31:30.499 --> 31:31.633
You believed that?

31:31.633 --> 31:33.666
So everything you said just now was a lie?

31:33.666 --> 31:35.266
Most of it was true.

31:35.266 --> 31:37.233
For example, you can defeat him.

31:37.233 --> 31:38.766
That part is true.

31:38.766 --> 31:40.196
Clearly I lost.

31:40.196 --> 31:41.560
That part is not true.

31:41.560 --> 31:43.900
That isn't over.

31:43.900 --> 31:44.980
After this battle,

31:44.980 --> 31:47.133
you've overcome your fear of him.

31:47.133 --> 31:48.859
Defeating him is only a matter of time.

31:48.859 --> 31:50.066
Besides,

31:50.066 --> 31:52.233
that was as good as he'd ever get.

31:52.233 --> 31:55.056
I don't think he'll make any more progress.

31:57.066 --> 31:59.233
You said you are Ding Zhao Hui.

31:59.233 --> 32:00.533
Is that true?

32:00.533 --> 32:01.966
Of course it's true.

32:01.966 --> 32:03.466
The Zhan family and we
have shared blood for generations.

32:03.466 --> 32:05.066
Zhan Zhao and I grew up together.

32:05.066 --> 32:07.333
He and my sister were betrothed as children.

32:07.333 --> 32:10.420
My father even taught him
the Ding family's secret technique.

32:10.420 --> 32:12.140
Though they aren't married yet,

32:12.140 --> 32:14.100
he's my future brother-in-law.

32:14.100 --> 32:15.566
Anything you wish to know about him,

32:15.566 --> 32:18.005
I have the answers.

32:25.387 --> 32:28.810
[The hostage exchange. Jiangjia Village.]

32:34.666 --> 32:37.233
Chieftain Zhong, say something!

32:39.333 --> 32:40.366
Commander Shao,

32:40.366 --> 32:41.933
a peerless hero,

32:41.933 --> 32:43.966
captured by a little girl?

32:43.966 --> 32:46.100
That's hardly possible.

32:46.100 --> 32:48.300
This was clearly torn from his clothes.

32:48.300 --> 32:49.333
What's left to doubt?

32:49.333 --> 32:50.960
We've searched every inch of the ferry.

32:50.960 --> 32:52.633
There's no sign of them.

32:52.633 --> 32:55.133
What else could it be?

32:55.133 --> 32:58.533
We bled to catch Zhan Zhao.

32:58.533 --> 33:00.100
We can't just let him go.

33:00.100 --> 33:02.066
His Lordship gave a strict order.

33:02.066 --> 33:04.499
Zhan Zhao can't leave Xiangzhou.

33:04.499 --> 33:06.833
His Lordship values Commander Shao.

33:06.833 --> 33:09.432
He won't just leave him to die.

33:12.066 --> 33:14.266
Then send word back to His Lordship.

33:14.266 --> 33:17.020
We'll wait for his command before we act.

33:17.020 --> 33:18.621
The kidnappers say the exchange

33:18.621 --> 33:19.833
will happen at dawn.

33:19.833 --> 33:20.933
If we send word back now,

33:20.933 --> 33:22.333
when does the reply come back?

33:22.333 --> 33:23.440
You must be on purpose.

33:23.440 --> 33:25.480
Commander Shao's life is indeed important,

33:25.480 --> 33:28.760
but are His Lordship's orders not important?

33:33.000 --> 33:35.000
Why are you here?

33:35.830 --> 33:38.160
His Lordship thought you were shorthanded,

33:38.160 --> 33:40.480
so he sent me to help.

33:42.576 --> 33:46.080
I thought capturing Zhan Zhao

33:46.080 --> 33:49.576
would be the end of it.

33:49.576 --> 33:53.432
But one move, taking Shao Ji Zu,
and you've lost all sense of direction.

33:53.432 --> 33:54.766
Well then, Master Zhi Hua,

33:54.766 --> 33:56.066
what brilliant plan do you have?

33:56.066 --> 33:57.520
Why don't you tell us,

33:57.520 --> 34:00.360
and give us some sense of direction?

34:00.360 --> 34:03.166
If you had caught Zhan Zhao in Yicheng County,

34:03.166 --> 34:05.603
would we even have all this trouble now?

34:05.603 --> 34:07.066
Even if the sky falls,

34:07.066 --> 34:09.933
I shouldn't be the one most anxious, right?

34:09.933 --> 34:11.989
If that object in Zhan Zhao's hands

34:11.989 --> 34:14.029
reaches the court,

34:14.029 --> 34:18.140
that's when the sky truly falls.

34:18.140 --> 34:21.213
If he ruins
His Lordship's painstaking work in Xiangzhou,

34:21.213 --> 34:23.153
all of us here

34:23.153 --> 34:25.319
will be buried with him.

34:28.140 --> 34:29.433
Master Zhi,

34:29.433 --> 34:31.569
speak freely, whatever is on your mind.

34:31.569 --> 34:33.560
As long as Commander Shao is rescued,

34:33.560 --> 34:34.949
I can't speak for others,

34:34.949 --> 34:37.333
but the prefectural court is yours to command.

34:37.333 --> 34:38.733
In the battle at Xiqiao Ferry,

34:38.733 --> 34:41.380
Chieftain Zhong, you exhausted yourself

34:41.380 --> 34:43.759
capturing the Southern Knight.

34:43.759 --> 34:45.433
This time,

34:45.433 --> 34:47.099
you should stay here.

34:47.099 --> 34:53.023
Can you spare half of Iron Blood Guards here
to march with Feng Shao and me?

35:22.360 --> 35:24.640
How is it? Anyone suspicious?

35:24.640 --> 35:25.936
Not at all.

35:25.936 --> 35:27.973
Did we look in the wrong place?

35:28.540 --> 35:29.860
It can't be wrong.

35:29.860 --> 35:33.233
The cloth says the exchange
will be at Jiangjia Village.

35:33.233 --> 35:35.359
Check the riverbank.

35:35.359 --> 35:37.033
Right. Let's go check the riverbank.

35:37.033 --> 35:38.657
Yes.

35:55.866 --> 35:56.920
There's a boat over there.

35:56.920 --> 35:58.760
Go take a look.

36:06.563 --> 36:08.346
Commander Shao!

36:11.123 --> 36:12.940
It's a trap! Get back!

36:12.940 --> 36:14.673
Get back!

36:19.980 --> 36:21.420
Where is Zhong Xiong?

36:21.420 --> 36:23.486
Zhong Xiong!

36:23.486 --> 36:25.773
Give me a hand! Hurry!

36:31.019 --> 36:32.931
Careful.

36:34.419 --> 36:37.615
What happened? What happened here?

37:13.720 --> 37:15.343
With so many people watching him,

37:15.343 --> 37:18.019
he must've done something really big.

38:02.786 --> 38:04.767
Zhan!

38:06.419 --> 38:07.850
Zhan!

38:27.153 --> 38:29.892
Go. I'll be right behind you.

38:58.388 --> 39:00.071
[Yanling]

39:50.220 --> 39:51.786
I'm taking Zhan Zhao with me.

39:51.786 --> 39:53.660
Do yourself a favor.

39:53.660 --> 39:55.667
Stand down.

40:22.886 --> 40:24.620
Are you sure there were two of them?

40:24.620 --> 40:25.746
One was wearing white.

40:25.746 --> 40:27.853
Yes. The other person

40:27.853 --> 40:29.486
was holding a very powerful weapon.

40:29.486 --> 40:31.086
It's the Yin Yang An.

40:31.086 --> 40:32.253
Commander Shao,

40:32.253 --> 40:33.820
why didn't you tell us sooner

40:33.820 --> 40:36.453
that Zhan Zhao's helper is from Linglong Manor?

40:36.453 --> 40:38.640
Didn't you seal a betrothal with them?

40:38.640 --> 40:40.503
Why are they helping an outsider?

40:40.503 --> 40:42.886
Ling Long was now bewitched by a villain.

40:42.886 --> 40:46.353
No wonder your previous attempts all failed.

40:46.353 --> 40:47.886
Could it be

40:47.886 --> 40:51.953
the betrothal to Ling Long stayed your hand?

40:51.953 --> 40:54.953
I miscalculated that.

40:54.953 --> 40:56.626
But how did they find out

40:56.626 --> 40:58.820
that Zhan Zhao was here?

40:58.820 --> 41:00.219
Chieftain Zhong,

41:00.219 --> 41:02.086
after we left,

41:02.086 --> 41:04.419
did you withdraw all Iron Blood Guards?

41:04.419 --> 41:06.153
Of course.

41:06.153 --> 41:07.986
Zhan Zhao had already been captured.

41:07.986 --> 41:10.576
Why are my brothers still being kept there?

41:13.953 --> 41:16.286
They followed the Iron Blood Guards here.

41:16.286 --> 41:19.153
Then who exactly is this young man in white?

41:19.153 --> 41:21.653
So young, but already so bold and clever.

41:21.653 --> 41:23.653
When I first met him,

41:23.653 --> 41:25.753
he said he was Ding Zhao Hui.

41:25.753 --> 41:27.820
- Ding Zhao Hui?
- Impossible.

41:27.820 --> 41:29.653
I've fought him before.

41:29.653 --> 41:31.953
It's not the Ding family's martial arts style.

41:31.953 --> 41:34.253
He's definitely lying.

41:34.253 --> 41:35.853
This man's martial arts are superb.

41:35.853 --> 41:37.753
And his moves are very strange.

41:37.753 --> 41:39.953
I can't tell which sect his skills belong to.

41:39.953 --> 41:41.353
His lightness skill is excellent.

41:41.353 --> 41:44.220
It rivals even that of the Huo family.

41:50.820 --> 41:52.453
Where are we going now?

41:52.453 --> 41:54.186
Xiqiao Ferry?

41:54.186 --> 41:56.620
Try to cross the river before they catch up.

41:56.620 --> 41:59.820
They're riding the crown's finest horses.

41:59.820 --> 42:01.453
We've got a wagon

42:01.453 --> 42:03.153
and a wounded man.

42:03.153 --> 42:04.786
How can we outrun them?

42:04.786 --> 42:06.186
Besides,

42:06.186 --> 42:07.553
I don't think the man inside

42:07.553 --> 42:10.255
can handle this rough ride.

42:22.886 --> 42:24.586
His breath is so weak.

42:24.586 --> 42:26.705
No different from a dead man.

42:42.053 --> 42:43.932
What did you feed him?

42:43.932 --> 42:45.786
Linglong Honey.

42:45.786 --> 42:47.153
It can't save his life,

42:47.153 --> 42:49.286
but at least it eases his pain.

42:49.286 --> 42:50.886
Useless.

42:50.886 --> 42:53.620
Old Souls at First Glance
has wounded him deeply.

42:53.620 --> 42:55.639
Then what should we do?

42:57.419 --> 42:59.791
You seem so worried about him.

43:00.686 --> 43:02.641
Give me a hand.
